      ":question/problem": "Calculate $\\frac{2}{5}W$, if \n$W=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{4}{5} & - \\frac{1}{4} & - \\frac{5}{3} \\\\ - \\frac{2}{3} & \\frac{5}{4} & \\frac{1}{5}\\end{bmatrix}.$",
